  "finding": "seat_s4_resume_v1 resolves a backend and reserves runtime memory but does not bind an accepted native claim owner before start_segment. Q36 segment entry does not call require_native_routing_job_v2. Segment results and matched masks retain no original routing decision for refresh before receipt signing.",
