  ],
  "proposed_ownership_chain": [
    "Obtain exact original native Some(owner) or explicit None before backend replay; reserve job/prompt/guard retention before allocation.",
    "Bind that same backend to the original owner and retain plan lease through actual segment restore and replay.",
    "Carry guard in task result through detached/running/done storage.",
    "Preserve guards beside matched segment mask; revalidate before reuse and receipt signing.",
    "Keep transient Resource/read failures retryable; retire known changed local identity without conviction or monetary penalty."
