  "reuse": "Generalize the existing FP BoundFpReplayV2/FpReplayRoutingGuardV2 and refresh_fp_routed_with_v2 pattern rather than creating an authority from a capture. FP-specific execution/count semantics must not be silently assumed for all segments.",
